## 模块二：成绩录入流程

### 2.1 模块概述

| 项目 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| **入口端** | 教师端 |
| **接口路径** | `PUT /api/teacher/score`（单条）/ `PUT /api/teacher/score/batch`（批量） |
| **权限要求** | `ROLE_TEACHER` 或 `ROLE_ADMIN` |
| **核心类** | TeacherController → SelectionService.updateScore → SelectionMapper |
| **数据隔离** | 教师只能查看/录入自己教授课程的成绩（`teacher_id` 隔离） |
| **缓存策略** | 更新成绩后清除 `mySelections` 缓存 |

### 2.2 完整调用链路

```
① 教师在 ScoreEntry.vue 选择课程 → 跳转 ScoreDetail.vue
② GET /api/teacher/selections 拉取该课程的学生选课记录（teacher_id 隔离）
③ 教师输入成绩 → 单条保存 POST /api/teacher/score
   或勾选学生批量录入 POST /api/teacher/score/batch
④ TeacherController.updateScore() 接收 ScoreUpdateDTO
⑤ SelectionService.updateScore() 更新 selection 表的 score 字段
⑥ 学生端 GET /api/student/my-selections 查看更新后的成绩
```

### 2.3 前端实现

#### 成绩录入页面（ScoreDetail.vue）

```vue
<template>
  <!-- 学生成绩表格 -->
  <el-table :data="selections">
    <el-table-column prop="studentName" label="学生姓名" />
    <el-table-column prop="courseName" label="课程" />
    <el-table-column label="成绩">
      <template slot-scope="scope">
        <el-input-number v-model="scope.row.score" :min="0" :max="100" :precision="1" />
      </template>
    </el-table-column>
    <el-table-column label="操作">
      <template slot-scope="scope">
        <el-button @click="saveScore(scope.row)">保存</el-button>
      </template>
    </el-table-column>
  </el-table>

  <!-- 批量录入 -->
  <div>
    <el-input-number v-model="batchScore" :min="0" :max="100" />
    <el-button @click="batchInput">批量录入</el-button>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
// 单条成绩保存
async saveScore(row) {
  const res = await request.put('/api/teacher/score', {
    selectionId: row.id,
    score: row.score
  });
  this.$message.success('成绩保存成功');
}

// 批量录入（勾选的学生统一设为同一分数）
async batchInput() {
  const scores = this.selectedRows.map(r => ({
    selectionId: r.id,
    score: this.batchScore
  }));
  const res = await request.put('/api/teacher/score/batch', { scores });
  this.$message.success('批量录入成功');
}
</script>
```

### 2.4 Controller 层

```java
// TeacherController.java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/teacher")
@PreAuthorize("hasRole('TEACHER') or hasRole('ADMIN')")
public class TeacherController {

    @Autowired private SelectionService selectionService;
    @Autowired private UserService userService;

    /**
     * 查询选课记录（教师只能看自己教的课）
     * 按 学期/课程/学生姓名 筛选
     */
    @GetMapping("/selections")
    public Result<List<SelectionVO>> querySelections(
            @AuthenticationPrincipal UserDetails userDetails,
            @RequestParam(required = false) String term,
            @RequestParam(required = false) Integer courseId,
            @RequestParam(required = false) String studentName) {
        Integer teacherId = userService.getUserIdByUsername(userDetails.getUsername());
        // teacher_id 隔离：只返回该教师课程下的选课记录
        List<SelectionVO> list = selectionService.getSelectionsByCondition(
                teacherId, term, courseId, studentName);
        return Result.success(list);
    }

    /**
     * 录入/更新成绩（单条）
     * @RequestBody ScoreUpdateDTO: { selectionId, score }
     */
    @PutMapping("/score")
    public Result<?> updateScore(@RequestBody ScoreUpdateDTO dto) {
        selectionService.updateScore(dto.getSelectionId(), dto.getScore());
        return Result.success();
    }

    /**
     * 批量录入成绩
     * @RequestBody BatchScoreDTO: { scores: [{selectionId, score}, ...] }
     */
    @PutMapping("/score/batch")
    public Result<?> batchUpdateScore(@RequestBody BatchScoreDTO dto) {
        if (dto.getScores() != null) {
            for (ScoreUpdateDTO s : dto.getScores()) {
                selectionService.updateScore(s.getSelectionId(), s.getScore());
            }
        }
        return Result.success();
    }
}
```

### 2.5 DTO 数据传输对象

```java
// ScoreUpdateDTO.java — 单条成绩更新
@Data
public class ScoreUpdateDTO {
    private Integer selectionId;  // 选课记录ID
    private Float score;          // 分数（0-100）
}

// BatchScoreDTO.java — 批量成绩录入
@Data
public class BatchScoreDTO {
    private List<ScoreUpdateDTO> scores;  // 多条成绩记录
}
```

### 2.6 Service 层

```java
// SelectionService.java
/**
 * 更新成绩: 教师录入/修改单个学生成绩
 * 清除该学生的选课缓存（mySelections）
 */
public void updateScore(Integer selectionId, Float score) {
    // 1. 查询选课记录
    Selection selection = selectionMapper.selectById(selectionId);
    if (selection != null) {
        // 2. 设置新成绩
        selection.setScore(score);
        // 3. 更新数据库
        selectionMapper.updateById(selection);  // UPDATE selection SET score=? WHERE id=?
        // 4. 清除缓存日志
        log.info("🔴 [Redis] 清除缓存 mySelections::{}（原因：成绩更新）",
                 selection.getStudentId());
    }
}
```

### 2.7 Mapper 层（教师查询选课记录）

```java
// SelectionMapper.java — 教师条件查询（动态SQL）
@Select("<script>" +
        "SELECT s.id, s.student_id, s.course_id, s.score, s.select_time, " +
        "c.name AS course_name, c.credit, c.term, " +
        "u.real_name AS student_name " +
        "FROM selection s " +
        "LEFT JOIN course c ON s.course_id = c.id " +
        "LEFT JOIN user u ON s.student_id = u.id " +
        "WHERE c.teacher_id = #{teacherId} " +  // 固定条件：只查该教师的课
        "<if test='term != null and term != \"\"'> AND c.term = #{term} </if>" +
        "<if test='courseId != null'> AND s.course_id = #{courseId} </if>" +
        "<if test='studentName != null and studentName != \"\"'>" +
        " AND u.real_name LIKE CONCAT('%',#{studentName},'%') </if>" +
        "</script>")
List<SelectionVO> selectByCondition(@Param("teacherId") Integer teacherId,
                                    @Param("term") String term,
                                    @Param("courseId") Integer courseId,
                                    @Param("studentName") String studentName);
```

**动态SQL说明**：
- `<script>` 标签让 MyBatis 解析其中的动态标签
- `<if>` 标签实现条件拼接：参数为 null 则不拼接到 SQL
- `LIKE CONCAT('%',#{},'%')` 实现模糊搜索
- `#{}` 占位符防止 SQL 注入

### 2.8 成绩录入流程图

```
教师登录 → ScoreEntry.vue（课程列表）
    │
    │  GET /api/teacher/my-courses
    ▼
选择课程 → ScoreDetail.vue（学生表格）
    │
    │  GET /api/teacher/selections?courseId=123
    │  （teacher_id 隔离，只返回自己的学生）
    ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│  单条录入           批量录入  │
│  输入分数+保存     勾选+批量  │
└──────────┬──────────────────┘
           │
   PUT /api/teacher/score      PUT /api/teacher/score/batch
   {selectionId, score}        {scores:[{selectionId,score}...]}
           │                           │
           ▼                           ▼
    SelectionService.updateScore (循环调用)
           │
           ▼
    UPDATE selection SET score=? WHERE id=?
           │
           ▼
    清除 mySelections 缓存
           │
           ▼
    学生端刷新可见新成绩 ✅
```

### 2.9 学生端查看成绩

```java
// StudentController.java
@GetMapping("/my-selections")
public Result<List<SelectionVO>> getMySelections(@AuthenticationPrincipal UserDetails userDetails) {
    Integer studentId = userService.getUserIdByUsername(userDetails.getUsername());
    return Result.success(selectionService.getSelectionsByStudentId(studentId));
    // @Cacheable 走 Redis 缓存，未命中查 MySQL
}

@GetMapping("/stats")
public Result<Map<String, Object>> getStats(@AuthenticationPrincipal UserDetails userDetails) {
    Integer studentId = userService.getUserIdByUsername(userDetails.getUsername());
    List<SelectionVO> list = selectionService.getSelectionsByStudentId(studentId);
    // Java Stream 计算统计
    long gradedCourses = list.stream().filter(s -> s.getScore() != null).count();
    double totalCredits = list.stream()
            .filter(s -> s.getScore() != null && s.getCredit() != null)
            .mapToDouble(SelectionVO::getCredit).sum();
    long passedCourses = list.stream().filter(s -> s.getScore() != null && s.getScore() >= 60).count();
    double avgScore = gradedCourses > 0 ? totalScore / gradedCourses : 0;
    // 返回：总门数/总学分/已过/不及格数/平均分
}
```

